    "description": {
      "content": "OSIsoft PI Web API (now part of AVEVA) provides a REST interface for accessing the PI System process historian. APIs enable real-time and historical time-series data retrieval, event frame queries, asset framework hierarchy navigation, and calculated data for industrial process monitoring.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: AVEVA Support",
